    <guid isPermaLink="false">685a2b022a38b4d979395c5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 05:06:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>5月、6月的月度回顾，我们终于两个人凑在一起录啦！感恩我们的J人究极在没有空调的闷热巴黎剪辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道何时会养狗的小贾</span></p><span></span><p><span>2026年一定会养狗的究极</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客大概】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 小贾日本归来的感悟：是谁偷走了我的钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">4:40</a> 被制造的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 猜猜究极有多少根口红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 一种恋物癖：“我只相信拥有的具象证明”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 过去的价值是在不断回忆中增加的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 生育的“自由“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 我们到底何时会养狗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> 能否在自己不知道生命热情所在的情况下养育一个新生命？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 如何跳出虚无主义的循环</span></p><span></span><p><span>【找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作邮箱：tiantianshihaotian@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《爱是一本书》- 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不值得》 - 梦飞船</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黑暗中漫舞》 - 陈奕迅</span></p>]]></description>
