  <item>
    <title>vol.22 尼泊尔ABC徒步｜离开水才知我本是鱼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b83eedb57cd35f70f1dd6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681b83eedb57cd35f70f1dd6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 16:15:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小贾徒步归来，在阿王煮物和2Q录这期播客，背景一直有阿王在厨房忙碌的声音，希望大家见谅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在尼泊尔徒步拉肚子4天只瘦了一斤的 - 小贾</span></p><span></span><p><span>在上海集中网球训练整个五一的 - 2Q</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期大概】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">0:30</a> 五一近况更新、浅谈张潇雨更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">5:50</a> 为什么去爬尼泊尔ABC？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 如何最佳性价比地准备徒步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 带着朋友的祝福和保佑爬山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> 从尼泊尔回来最大的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 从只想爬山到在山上发现更自由的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 对于安全大环境的依恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 发朋友圈的时候发现尼泊尔之行不是关于山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 在新西兰徒步的毛东也对银河流泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 尼泊尔之后幸福也有了厚重感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 关于爬山本质是一个很中产的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">51:05</a> 舍不得大家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 理想是在山头当村长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3657">1:00:57</a> 为什么还在期待乌托邦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4335">1:12:15</a> 竹子：人生最重要的东西是深入的亲密关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4445">1:14:05</a> “我对爬山的大家是有依恋的啦～”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝莲花 - 许巍</span></p><span></span><p><span>额尔敦山影 - Emma艾玛 Allen</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62f139a0efbb0c4a3fbe363e/lmbYttrz3PumOjCqJb9wAYaiTtgs.m4a" length="113733230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lut1aWaxiPzDv42P0rczIR-Jn4V8.png"/>
