  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 离家做留子，上山当猴子：老中人四处出逃的一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c05b5205a90dfd0d43fd83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c05b5205a90dfd0d43fd83</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 12:48:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>是的，小贾和究极还记得我们有一个播客孩子。</span></p><p><span>我们在播客里flag一个月一更，现在已经2月了。</span></p><p><span>时间不存在，我们的内容也不会过时。</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>告别旅行热情自作聪明（不）爱兼职的静安打工人小贾</span></p><p><span>一辈子离不开做题恋爱也想做五三的巴黎实习生究极</span></p><p><span>【播客大概】</span></p><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a> 老中人的小尾巴：做题学法语</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">9:10</a> 另一种老中遗病：失去旅行的乐趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 我们的privilege：躺一点也能活着的生活</span></p><p><span>“那不是更幸福的生活，那只是更有钱的生活”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 小贾精力翻倍的妙计</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 聪明的东亚人怎么会满足于只打一份工呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 究极2024年的读很多书的妙计</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3057">50:57</a> 如何面对我们爱的主播被批判？要反驳吗？自我反思吗？还是带着傲慢接纳？</span></p><p><span>【找到我们】</span></p><p><span>合作邮箱：tiantianshihaotian@163.com</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>Echo by She Her Her Hers/ Sweet John</span></p><p><span>Freezing by Bren Joy</span></p><p><span>Hallucinogenics by Matt Maeson/Lana Del Rey</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62f139a0efbb0c4a3fbe363e/lv7-0aagACqn1P0I0k5--3d3PT9E.m4a" length="95886213" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fir_Bfj0rkhpsRacVQa4PLeM4Ph2.png"/>
